- Technical Details
    - Tech Stack:
        - Bash scripts
        - tmux 3.4
        - fzf 0.44.1
    - Key Files:
        - bin/tm: Main dispatcher
        - bin/tm-picker: Interactive fzf session picker
        - bin/tm-cheatsheet: ANSI formatted cheatsheet
        - conf/tmux.conf: tmux configuration (Ctrl+T prefix)
        - data/: loglog data files for commands, keybindings, cheatsheet
        - install.sh: Symlinks config and binary
    - Architecture Notes:
        - Data-driven: commands and keybindings defined in data/ files
        - Ctrl+T prefix replaces Ctrl+B
        - Alt+Arrows for resize (Fn+Arrows not portable on Linux)
        - Mouse wheel enters copy mode for scrolling history

